police in the Dominican Republic  arrested a second suspect overnight in  connection with the shooting of Red Sox  legend David Ortiz Big Papi it's still  unclear why Ortiz was shot and our  mullet leg is outside the bar where it  happened in Santo Domingo molla what  more do we know today well so far police  have not named this person or indicated  whether this person is in fact the  suspected shooter police have detained  at least five people for questioning  since Sunday's shooting that happened  right here at the dial bar and lounge in  the entertainment district of Santo  Domingo  Ortiz was actually sitting right here on  this patio deck of the dial bar and  lounge when the motorcyclist approached  the gunman hopped off approached Ortiz  and shot him in the back but police are  still investigating whether Ortiz was  the intended target of the shooting the  first suspect was transferred to court  in Santo Domingo yesterday police say  Eddie Garcia was the motorcyclist who  brought the shooter to Ortiz he's  charged and as an accomplice to an  attempted murder but Garcia's lawyer  says that he is a fan of Ortiz and he  did not know what he was about to have  what he was about to take the shooter to  when he picked the shooter up in Boston  Ortiz took his first steps in the  hospital where he is recovering with the  help of his family he underwent a second  exploratory surgery there in Boston and  will stay in intensive care for at least  a few more days to avoid any sort of  internal bleeding and other  complications in a statement  Ortiz's wife Tiffany said that Ortiz is  expected to make a full recovery that he  is resting comfortably and of course she  thanked everyone for the love and  support that the family has received  Anthony mola Lengai in the Dominican  Republic thanks mola
 

